apply(ds4, P1, dup0): atomiswave: configured P1; dolphin: GCPad1 rebuilt from template, Wiimote1 set (SDL/0/PS4 Controller); dreamcast: configured P1; fds: configured P1; gamegear: configured P1; mame: configured P1; mastersystem: configured P1; megacd: configured P1; megadrive: configured P1; melonds: 8 keys mapped (SDL live); naomi: configured P1; naomigd: configured P1; nes: configured P1; pcengine: configured P1; pcenginecd: configured P1; rpcs3: Player 1 retargeted (PS4 Controller 1); ryujinx: Player 1 retargeted (dup 0, 00000003-054c-0000-cc09-000000006800); saturn: configured P1; sega32x: configured P1; sg1000: configured P1; snes9x: player 1 -> Joystick 1, 8 controls mapped (sdl); supergrafx: configured P1
apply(xbox, P2, dup0): atomiswave: configured P2; dolphin: GCPad2 rebuilt from GCPad1, Wiimote2 set (SDL/0/Xbox One Controller); dreamcast: configured P2; fds: configured P2; mame: configured P2; mastersystem: configured P2; megacd: configured P2; megadrive: configured P2; naomi: configured P2; naomigd: configured P2; nes: configured P2; rpcs3: Player 2 retargeted (Xbox One Controller 1); ryujinx: Player 2 retargeted (dup 0, 00000005-045e-0000-fd02-000003090000); saturn: configured P2; sega32x: configured P2; sg1000: configured P2; snes9x: player 2 -> Joystick 2, 8 controls mapped (sdl)
